window.products.push({"id":637010,"name":"Totally Bamboo Wine Bottle Cutting, Vino Serving Board","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YNHvAQ9ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The bamboo shape cutting & serving boards by Totally Bamboo are a functional addition to the kitchen and fun conversation starter when entertaining. Good for minor food prep and look great as serving pieces when entertaining or just on display on any kitchen counter or wall. Some shapes have a simple design and others have more intricate design details with end grain inlays or laser etched art. For best results, season new boards with Totally Bamboo Revitalizing mineral oil (sold separately) several times during the first month. Easy to care for, hand wash boards with warm water and mild detergent. Then occasionally treat with Totally Bamboo Revitalizing mineral oil to extend the life and beauty of your board. Bamboo is the alternative for all things wood in the kitchen! Totally Bamboo encourages and supports reducing the widespread practice of clear-cutting our precious hard wood forests by giving consumers a sustainable alternative. Bamboo is stronger than most hard woods and it is the fastest growing plant on our planet. It does not require any special care to grow. In fact, it is a grass that produces more oxygen than a hard wood forest of comparable size, therefore reducing carbon dioxide gases associated with climate change. It also prevents soil erosion through its widespread root system and large canopy. At Totally Bamboo, we are proud to use \"Moso\" timber bamboo for its strength, density, versatility and high quality. It is harvested from our own bamboo forests which are not a habitat or food source for the great Panda. Our factories adhere to very stringent protocol for curing and processing the bamboo, ensuring the highest quality Product. And we take steps to ensure that our employees are well taken care of and work in a safe and hazard free environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YNHvAQ9ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Totally Bamboo","source_asin":"B01E03V50G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-637010","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01E03V50G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01E03V50G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
