window.products.push({"id":637089,"name":"hülya Bamboo Adjustable Shredded Memory Foam Pillow | Eco-Friendly | Breathable | Comfortable | CertiPUR-US Filled | The Perfect Pillow for The Perfec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XGM9fT7DS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Perfect Pillow For A Perfect Night’s Sleep! Whether you are a back, stomach or side sleeper, and whether you prefer a soft, medium or firm pillow, our fully adjustable Bamboo Pillow will provide you the comfort and desired firmness you want and deserve for a perfect night’s sleep. Fall asleep faster, sleep better and wake up refreshed! Hülya pillows are breathable, comfortable and luxuriously soft to the touch, promoting proper back, neck and spine alignment. Our pillows help you sleep deeper while relieving tossing and turning, insomnia, migraines, snoring and those annoying morning neck aches and pains. Our pillows are eco-friendly. Bamboo is a sustainable fiber that grows with very little effort and does not require fertilizers or pesticides. Our filling materials are up-cycled and sourced from US manufacturers, limiting land fill waste. The pillow cover and inner liner zippers allows for easy customization - adjust the pillow’s thickness to obtain your personal comfort level. Simply open the cover and liner to add or remove the filling to your personal liking. (1/2 lb. of additional CertiPUR-US memory foam blend provided) Hülya uses only a premium blend of up-cycled CertiPUR-US Certified shredded memory foam, latex foam and polyester fiber for our filling, all made in the USA. Sleep peacefully knowing hülya pillows are produced without ozone depleters and other bad stuff. (PBDE’s, TDCPP, TCEP flame retardants, mercury, lead and heavy metals, formaldehyde, phthalates CPSC, or CFC’s) Our pillow filling will not become lumpy or flat, thanks to our special filling blend. Our pillows always maintain their loft and shape, unlike pillows filled with only shredded memory foam, which become flat over time. Mold your pillow to conform to your body type and sleep position. In the morning, just give you pillow a quick fluff, and it is as good as new, day after day, night after night! Easy Care Machine Washable – Removable cover is washable. Machine was cold, mild detergent, air dry or dry on fluff cycle recommended. Pillow Sizes: Standard (18\" x 26\"), Queen (18\" x 30\"), King (18\" x 36\") Pillow Construction And Content: Pillow Cover (40% Bamboo From Viscose/60% Polyester), Filling (50% CertiPUR-US Memory Foam/25% Latex Foam/25% Polyester Micro Fiber). Made in the USA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XGM9fT7DS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"hülya","source_asin":"B098PLCZZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-637089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098PLCZZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098PLCZZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
