window.products.push({"id":637132,"name":"COMONS 30CT DIY Clear Acrylic Plastic Fillable Ball Ornaments for Christmas Wedding Party Decorations (3.15''/80mm, Clear)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qjwob+2eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You will get 30 decorative balls. The ball has two opposite sides, so there are 30 male and 30 female hemispheres. Make sure you choose a male side and a female side so you can match a ball. Great for DIY crafts: You can put any small ornaments such as flowers, beads, photos, trinkets or pieces of ribbon inside the clear ball to make souvenirs during the holiday season, great for Christmas, birthdays, anniversaries, etc. Easy to use: Each sphere can be separated into two parts in order to open and close them freely. A plastic loop at top, slip a piece of ribbon, rope or wire through the loop to hang. Made of high quality plastic acrylic material. Transparent, durable, environmental protection. If you decide to change your decor or party theme, simply replace the inside of the ball instead of buying a new ball.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qjwob+2eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COMONS","source_asin":"B0B3XCD24F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-637132","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3XCD24F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3XCD24F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
