window.products.push({"id":637398,"name":"Wilton Christmas Santa's Mustache Lollipop Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aNXGOy4aL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Decorate fun, festive candy lollipops this season with the Christmas Santa's Mustache Lollipop Kit. The kit contains everything you need to mold 12 mustaches-shaped lollipops. They're fun to serve at Christmas parties, especially when guests snap a few photos before eating. Or, give these lollipops as sweet, homemade gifts to everyone on your gift-giving list. Kit contains four candy molds, 12 oz. bright white Candy Melts candy, 12 in. disposable decorating bag, 12 lollipop sticks, 12 red ribbons and instructions. Made on equipment that also processes peanuts. Candy Melts and decorating bag made in USA. Molds made in Taiwan. Sticks and ribbons made in China.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aNXGOy4aL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wilton","source_asin":"B00KKV95QE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-637398","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KKV95QE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KKV95QE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":637399,"name":"Peru Watercolor Map Art by Michael Tompsett in Black Frame, Acrylic Paper 16 by 20-Inch, White Matte","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AS4JJxIVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, matted framed art piece features a colorful watercolor map of Peru. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies after leaving University. After 12 highly enjoyable years Michael Tompsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Although Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, his main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Michael Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs. An 11x14 giclee print under acrylic in a 16x20 black frame. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions. The piece is printed on high quality, archival paper that is textured. A clear acrylic facing is added to protect the print. The piece is fully assembled by professional framers and comes ready to hang. The antique white mat allows the image to really stand out, making it a great addition to any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AS4JJxIVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00LAYOA88","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-637399","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LAYOA88","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LAYOA88","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
