window.products.push({"id":637448,"name":"Trademark Fine Art Dog Days III by Ethan Harper, 24x32","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":61.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Pk7FJbOQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features an illustrative dog sleeping in the center of the frame. Prominent colors: white, grey world art Group is a leading art publisher located in Richmond, Virginia. We have been producing wall decor for over 40 years. Formerly known as old world prints, world art Group publishes a comprehensive line of imagery ranging from very traditional to highly contemporary. With Weekly releases, covering every subject matter and every price range, we produce over 4, 000 images a year. In addition to collaborating with artists from around the world, world art Group has its own in-house design team vision studio. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Pk7FJbOQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B07MHJSXS1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-637448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MHJSXS1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MHJSXS1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
