window.products.push({"id":637470,"name":"Revere 2000 Line 10-Inch Stainless-Steel Open Skillet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31SYNRBGS6L._AC_.jpg","description":"This historical cookware maker's legacy can be traced all the way back to Paul Revere, who founded the first incarnation of the Revere company. Today's Revere Ware is designed with modern-day convenience in mind as evidenced by this 10-inch open skillet. As part of the Tri-Ply Bottom collection, the pan is constructed of durable, shiny stainless steel with the bottom featuring an encapsulated aluminum disk between two layers of stainless steel for quick and even heat distribution. It's additionally coated with a nonstick surface so food removes easily from the pan and oils and fats quickly clean off. Oven safe to 350 degrees F, the pan's phenolic coating on the pistol-grip handle provides a comfortable and safe grip. Measuring approximately 10-1/2 by 18 by 2 inches, the pan carries a 25-year limited warranty and should be washed by hand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31SYNRBGS6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Revere","source_asin":"B00080QDOE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-637470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00080QDOE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00080QDOE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
