window.products.push({"id":637520,"name":"25oz Vacuum Insulated Wine Growler, Holds Entire Wine Bottle, Leak Proof Flask Design, Also Great as a Thermos, Water Bottle or Canteen For Travel or ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cBCkG9g+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Us: We are blessed to call Fort Collins, Colorado our home.  Our goal is to create products for all of the adventures that life may call you to - camping, climbing a 14er, or maybe just relaxing by a river.  We want these products to be durable, easy to clean, and also enhance whatever beverage you choose to consume. Thank you for investing in our products and we hope that you are able to slow down, fully savor life and enjoy everyday moments, wherever your journey may take you. Summit Legacy: To live life with wonder and awe and enjoy all of the adventures that you encounter, even the ones that challenge you and push you beyond your limits as you continue to climb towards your destination.  The goal isn't always about reaching the summit but what we learn along the way. When we are challenged, we become who we were created to be. Most people think of a legacy as physical things that we leave behind.  Legacy is our story.  How we live our life and how we complete the work that has been set out before us. The impact that we have on others, those that we love, and the people we have yet to meet, in a way that is positive, encouraging and motivating.  We are connected through our stories. Quality and Performance: Pro-grade 18/8 stainless steel to protect against flavor transfer Pro-grade 18/8 stainless steel to protect against flavor transfer Advanced vacuum insulated technology to keep your drink the perfect temperature longer Advanced vacuum insulated technology to keep your drink the perfect temperature longer No heat transfer or condensation to the outside of the bottle No heat transfer or condensation to the outside of the bottle Powder coated exterior to provide additional texture and durability Powder coated exterior to provide additional texture and durability Removable Leak-Proof screw cap, perfect for all adventures Removable Leak-Proof screw cap, perfect for all adventures","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cBCkG9g+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Summit Legacy Products","source_asin":"B07GXZFGVV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-637520","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GXZFGVV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GXZFGVV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":637521,"name":"Bon Halter 12-Piece Stainless Steel Flatware Silverware Cutlery Set - Green, Include Knife/Fork/Spoon, Dishwasher Safe, Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+wremm3NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1.5/1.2 mm thickness stainless steel and matt polished Set includes 4 dinner knives, 4 dinner forks, and 4 teaspoons Dishwasher safe, durable and rust-resistant. Care Instructions:The flatware set is dishwasher safe under a temperature of 60 Celsius (°C). For best results, do not leave the set soaking for a long period of time. Dry promptly after cleaning. Lemon detergent is not recommended as it may cause erosion. Presented in a mail box","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+wremm3NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bon","source_asin":"B07CCMNFJB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-637521","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CCMNFJB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CCMNFJB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":637522,"name":"DecorShore 23 Inch Decorative Wall Clock, Silent Clock with Decorative Glass Mosaic, Oversized Wall Clock (Retro Rainbow - Turquoise, Ruby Red & Golde","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gf3vr+RIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NEW ARRIVAL / FIRST RUN / VERY LIMITED QUANTITIES...The perfect clock for any room. Our oversized wall clock is 23 inches in diameter and features dazzling jewel tone mosaic tiles. Hand laid glass mosaic tiles reflect light and provide the touch of glamour you crave. The large size of our clock is the perfect statement piece for Spanish Colonial Decorating, your modern bohemian retreat, or a great addition to global wanderlust finds. The artisan craftsmanship extends much further than hand-applied mosaic tiles. Each clock is made of a cast iron base, molded using the ancient crucible method. The decorative mosaic glass contains jewel toned underlayment that is hand dyed and cut in an intricate triangular pattern. Sheeted glass is fused to the shiny jewel tone underlayment , and each piece is hand cut into one cm scalene triangular mosaic tiles. Each delicate glass bead is hand molded and applied to the clock’s bezel frame. The centered, mechanical clock presents the best of classical finishing touches - a genuine glass dome clock face, rare and incredibly chic. The beautiful glass tile mosaic pattern is an aesthetic wonder, featuring over 1,500 luminous tiles. This artisanal handicraft extends far beyond being 'just a clock.' The luxury looks are capable of standing alone as a room's decorative centerpiece. Each oversized wall clock is as much fine art as it is a functional decorative timepiece. Transitional design appeal and elegant looks make our collection of decorative clocks our second most popular decor item of all time. Please note that because each piece is handmade, slight variations and minor blemishes are to be expected and are a part of the charm of handmade items. Available in this collection: Golden Sands, Retro Rainbow and Gemstone Rainbow Clocks. If your favorite color isn’t available now, check back in a month or two. Due to the limited availability, production time and popularity of these items; they sell out fast.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gf3vr+RIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DecorShore","source_asin":"B074X7NPFH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-637522","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074X7NPFH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074X7NPFH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
