window.products.push({"id":637598,"name":"GMISUN Black Soap Dispenser, 2 Pack 16oz Glass Hand and Dish Soap Dispenser for Kitchen Sink/Bathroom, Morden Refillable Liquid Soap Dispenser Set wit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613zt+2dIDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Modern Black Soap Dispenser】The black glass soap dispenser perfectly matches any kitchen sink and bathroom accessories, adding a more rustic, vintage, modern, farmhouse touch to the house. The black soap bottle can still maintain the quality of liquid soap under strong light. Made of the rustproof matte black pump and thicker lead-free glass, ensure liquid durability and safety, such as dish soap, hand soap, shampoo, lotion. 【Glass Soap Dispenser With Non-Drip Stainless Steel Pump】Matte black stainless steel pumps are used higher-quality 304 materials, the heavy-duty weight of 52g, which is increased by 50% stainless steel. Instead of the other cheap 201 material on the market, our pumps didn't rust and fade after the high salinity test. The soap pump dispenser is made with 2CC pump core and a wider pipe can easily dispense the required amount of liquid. 【Thicker Glass Hand And Dish Soap Dispenser Set】The dish soap dispenser is made of 100% lead-free thicker glass to ensure heavy-duty sturdy glass and liquid soap safety, which is definitely an improvement on the plastic soap dispenser. The non-slip bottom allows the glass bottle not easy to fall down. 16oz/480ml large capacity, we don't need to refill the soap frequently. Ideal 2-pack refillable soap dispenser for kitchen sink and bathroom countertop. 【Waterproof Soap Labels For Liquid Organization】Comes with 4 waterproof soap stickers: Hand Soap, Dish Soap, Shampoo, Conditioner, no worry to touch it with wet hand. They can match with any modern or rustic farmhouse-style kitchen accessories. And the simple black text is clear and easy to read, convenient for you to quickly distinguish liquid soap dispenser from different liquids. 【Carefully Packaged And Rustproof Warranty】GMISUN puts a soft layer on the top and bottom of the box to protect the hand soap dispenser, We added more packaging materials to reduce the damage to the soap dispenser set. If there is any damage or accessory omission to the product, please contact us, we will solve the issues to reach your satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613zt+2dIDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GM GMISUN","source_asin":"B09XHNNM7S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-637598","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XHNNM7S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XHNNM7S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
