window.products.push({"id":637688,"name":"Mr Hsiung & Mrs Yin 100L Over-Sized Organizer Storage Bag, Moving Bag with Reinforced Handle and Zipper, Laundry Bags, Extra Large Storage Bag for Clo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ybutKSiNL._AC_SL1248_.jpg","description":"Are you tired of any nasty surprises next time the temperature drops? Are you looking for some storage bags to store the clothes when seasons start to change? Are you looking for duvet storage bag to store extra blankets, pillows, towels? Our large capacity storage bag can help you ensure the safety of your clothes. ▶ Why is this choice? √ Large Enough : Each one alone is large enough for a thick winter down blanket or a lot of closing stuffs together. Big enough to store double duvet, and 2 pillows plus a throw √ Breathable : No more doing laundry to get rid of the plastic storage smell. You can go straight to the closet and put on clothing without smelling like a stale sandwich baggie. √ Sturdy & Firmly : The handles look durable for clothing or blanket kind of storage that fills up even the entire bag. Stainless steel zippers that allow it to easily slide along the closure when in use. √ Stackable : You can stack them on top of each other up together.  ▶ Size: √ 23.6\" *13.8\" *17.7\"(60 * 35 * 45 CM) Enough room for: ✔ 1 King Size Duvet + 2 Pillows. ✔ 2 King Size Duvet. ✔ Maybe all your T-shirt and pants in summer. ✔ 20 sweaters in winter. ✔ …...  ▶ You will get √ 2PCS * Large Capacity Thick Linen Storage Bags. √ 3 tips to store clothes: ✔ Get rid of clothes that you won't wear or love. ✔ Don’t use vac storage bags for long-term clothes storage. ✔ Store them in the dry, cool, clean and dark location. √ 100% Satisfaction Guarantee. Get yours today, you will become a home storage expert.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ybutKSiNL._AC_SL1248_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr Hsiung & Mrs Yin","source_asin":"B08JPY57N8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-637688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JPY57N8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JPY57N8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
