window.products.push({"id":637720,"name":"2pcs/set Girlfriend's Birthday Daughter Wedding Cake Server set Zinc Alloy Cake Knife Shovel Silver Plated Dessert Cutter, Flower Hollowed-out Small-S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sDCLhO9NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUALITY YOU CAN COUNT ON: Each serving utensil is made with food-grade, Zinc Alloy with Plating silver and provide a polished finish look.Both pieces are protected against exposure to water, making them rust and corrosion resistant. Hand-wash only. They will maintain their integrity for years to come. MAKE YOUR SPECIAL DAY EXTRA MEMORABLE: At All Thing Eternal, we understand that every last detail of your birthday has to be perfect. That’s why we created this beautiful 2-piece wedding/birthday cake cutter and server. With impeccable attention to detail, this cake serving kit will provide flawless execution as well as elevated aesthetics during the cake cutting ceremony. THE PERFECT CUT: When it comes to serving cake or pie, you want it to look as good as it tastes. Thus, achieving the perfect slice is important. The cake cutters equipped with razor-sharp, serrated edging to guarantee that every slice comes out perfectly symmetrical without cake and icing sticking to the edges.The shovel is relatively small. We recommend using it for cakes with no more than two layers and dividing the cake into small pieces. ELEGANT SERVE WARE:We prides itself on providing gorgeous, luxury accessories for weddings, anniversaries, engagement parties, and other important milestones. We created this cake cutting collection to promote beauty and elegance. As such, the handles of these utensils brandish a texturized, vine-and-flower pattern and hollowed. THE PERFECT KEEPSAKE: Our silver wedding cake set provides unyielding performance and integrity. As such, this 2-piece dessert set can be saved as a display item to remember your special day and the love you have as a couple. From us to you ~ Thanks for letting All Thing Eternal be part of these special moments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sDCLhO9NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BBO+1","source_asin":"B092225NPV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-637720","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092225NPV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092225NPV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
