window.products.push({"id":637741,"name":"Essos Macaron Boxes for 6 to 7 Brown (Kraft) with Clear Display Window [25 pieces] Macarons Container or Packaging Box Kit for Chocolate Truffles Cake","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71weJZJwy3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧁These simple boxes come with a clear plastic window and are perfect to showcase your handmade French macarons, small tea cakes or any home baked desserts. Keep your delicate treats safe with this box. 🧁Big enough to hold both homemade and store-bought macarons (holds 6-7 macarons depending on the thickness of the macarons). This macaron box is also suitable for small desserts, mini cupcakes, cookies and candy. Remove the divider of the larger box to hold even more. 🧁Tie a pretty ribbon around it or add a name tag to make it a gift. Small ornaments or neat lettering will instantly make this the perfect gift. The boxes come in a pack of 25 and is great for giving out as gifts at showers, weddings, baking competitions, fairs, or your business. Business pricing available! 🧁The containers come unassembled, but are easy to put together. Scroll to product description to watch our video to find out how. (Assembled box outside dimensions 2.75\"x 8.2\" x 2.2\", inside dimensions 2\" x 7.5\" x 2.1\"). ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐CUSTOMER SATISFACTION is our top priority. We want you to have a quality product when shopping with us. If you have any issues with our product, please contact us and we will work to resolve them as quickly as possible. Thank you for supporting a U.S. based small business.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71weJZJwy3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Essos","source_asin":"B07VY5TVPN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-637741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VY5TVPN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VY5TVPN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
