window.products.push({"id":637775,"name":"Portable Air Conditioner Jibeufi 4-In-1 Evaporative Air Cooler 3 Speeds 7 Colorful Light Timing Function Cool Mist Personal Small Mini Desktop Air Coo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J+FuKqKbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Efficient Cooling: Jibeufi evaporative air cooler adopt ultrasonic atomizer, high-performance motor, and unique air duct design, is able to reduce the surrounding temperature quickly and provide you with powerful, cool, refreshing airflow instantly, rather than being trapped by heat waves. Compact and handheld design make it widely used in home, bedroom, office, outdoor parties, camping and so on. Multi-Functional Air Conditioner Fan: Jibeufi 4-in-1 portable air conditioner, it is not only a desktop air cooler, but also a table fan, humidifier and aromatherapy machine (rotate to open the small round cover on the back of this machine). Besides, this mini personal cooling fan equipped with USB cable, you can easily get it charged by power bank, laptop, adapter, car charger. 3 Speeds & Powerful Cool Mist: Features with 3 speed modes (Natural/Med/High) and powerful cool mist, it can quickly cool down the surrounding temperature up to 45-50℉. Putting some ice cubes into the water tank and you will feel much better. In addition, the wind direction is 90°adjustable up & down according to your needs. Quiet Cooling& 7 Colors Light: This mini air conditioner is professionally designed with a unique air duct design and fluid mechanics, resulting in very little noise and you will not be disturbed by the noise. The 7-color atmosphere Lights create a comfortable and relaxing sleeping environment, providing you with a soothing and cooling sleep during hot summer nights. Timer Setting & Water-shortage Protection: This desktop cooling fan supports 2 kinds of timing modes (2H/4H), that can allow you enjoy reading or sleeping without the headaches caused by long-term cool air, and also help save the electricity bills. Besides, the water-shortage protection system will automatically turn off the mist button to protect the machine from damage when there is little water in the water tank. Professional Customer Service: We stand behind our portable air conditioners with a 30-day money-back and 90 days free exchange. Please immediately message us If you have any questions or concerns, our expert tech support is available to assist you within 12 hours. Shopping with confidence and enjoy the cooling wind in this hot summer. Warm Tips: The DC power part must ≥10W (5V 2A) when use this portable air conditioner, otherwise the machine can't work (Adapter not included in the package).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J+FuKqKbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jibeufi","source_asin":"B0C7C4WW3F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-637775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7C4WW3F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7C4WW3F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
