window.products.push({"id":637848,"name":"Serta Colton 85\" Upholstered Living Room Sofa with Removable Slip Covers, Modern Track Arm Fabric Couch, Soft Comfortable Cushions, Linen Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":762.11,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I8EVUhb-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you in need of a new sofa that will seamlessly pair with your current furniture? the Colton sofa from Serta is the perfect piece for you. The removable woven slipcover is high-quality and incredibly easy to clean for your convenience. Available in a variety of stylish colors, this sofa features thick cushions for optimal comfort and support. The single base provides extra strength and durability. Clean lines lend to a modern look without sacrificing comfort. When you choose Serta, you choose comfort. This piece is ready to assemble so it can be added to your space in 30 minutes or less!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I8EVUhb-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Serta","source_asin":"B08861DL8B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-637848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08861DL8B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08861DL8B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":637849,"name":"Set of 6 Square Wooden Coasters with Hand Engraved Holder- For Tea & Coffee Cups, Mugs, Beverages, Glass Drink Mats","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u5I0nCP2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Coaster Dimensions (H X W):  3.5 Inches * 3.5 Inches This set of 6 Burned Coasters are made from natural wood. Made from 100% high quality natural Mango wood, well known for its durability & beautiful color Rustic vintage look with food grade finish, safe for kitchen and dining purposes Hand-carved out of mango wood (with high resistance to water and decay) by traditional artisans from rural India An eye catching coasters for your bar, dining table, or coffee tea lounge and a unique gift idea too! Flaunt them when your friends and family come over for tea or coffee","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u5I0nCP2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The","source_asin":"B071J7FXW8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-637849","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071J7FXW8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071J7FXW8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":637850,"name":"Objet d'art Release No.476 \"Y Ddraig Goch\" Red Welsh Dragon Handmade Jeweled Trinket Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wbbr1lkML._AC_SL1396_.jpg","description":"Y Ddraig Goch or the \"the red dragon\" is associated with many things Welsh and appears on the national flag of Wales. The oldest known use of the dragon symbolizing Wales is from 829 AD and supposedly linked to the battle flag of King Arthur. In 1953, the Red Dragon badge of Henry VII was blazoned the motto \"Y ddraig Goch ddyry cychwyn or \"the red dragon inspires action\". This beautiful 100% handmade trinket box celebrates this era of Welch history in metal and fine crystal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wbbr1lkML._AC_SL1396_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Objet d' Art","source_asin":"B00A6MKWI2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-637850","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00A6MKWI2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00A6MKWI2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":637851,"name":"FrancisFrancis! X5 Espresso Machine, Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41X1AE9WJCL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Named after the sleek, invisible-to-radar airplane, the X-5 Espresso Machine from FrancisFrancis! meets the needs of small-kitchen owners with big coffee tastes. While the body of the X5 has been reduced to the minimum, its high-quality construction—including a brass broiler for thermal stability, a chrome-plated brass brewing head and a commercial-diameter brewing handle—ensures stupendous coffee. Use either the Easy Serving Espresso system (ESE)—pre-ground, single servings of espresso coffee packed in filter paper—or the Supercrema system for pre-ground coffee. A steamer arm froths milk for cappuccinos, and an easy-to-regulate, elegant clock gives the exact time. With a joie-de-vivre nod to both beauty and function, FrancisFrancis! takes the average out of the everyday. Made in Italy. 10-3/8Lx8-3/4Wx11-1/4H. Amazon.com FrancisFrancis! espresso machines aren't just a design dream aesthetically. They're also engineered to do much of the barista work for you, removing intimidation and trial-by-fire from the home espresso game. This fabulous-looking all-metal X5 model features a brass boiler and the Supercrema brewing system, pump-driven with 8-9 bars of dynamic pressure. The chrome-plated brass brewing handle maintains ideal temperatures for coffee, while the steam/hot water wand swivels for tidy storage. One of the friendliest aspects of the X5 is its ability to brew espresso with either pre-measured ESE (Easy Serving Espresso) coffee pods or with loose grounds from your favorite bean vendor. Two interchangeable handle baskets are included, one for each method. Three filters also come with the machine for pulling ristretto, regular, or lungo shots. Measuring 10-1/4 by 8-1/4 by 11-1/4 inches, the X5 is a relatively compact machine, built with flat sides to save space on tight countertops. Keep in mind that it weighs 16 pounds, so you'll want to make a permanent spot for it, and that the 48-ounce water tank is accessed from the back, so you'll need room to work behind it. The sleek little battery-powered clock on the front of the machine pops out for setting and battery replacement. FrancisFrancis! includes a detailed instruction and tip guide, as well as a starter container of Illy Café espresso. --Emily Bedard From the Manufacturer Obviously the X-Stealth, or X5, isnt really anti-radar, and, even if it was it wouldnt be of much use. Its called the X-Stealth because its angular, sloping form resembles that of the airplanes and ships invisible to radar. Its a machine for the small kitchen because its body has been reduced to the minimum. It makes stupendous coffee both with the Easy Serving Espresso (ESE) system and with ground coffee, thanks to the SUPERCREAM system. A beautifully centered clock gives the exact time and is easily regulated. With the side handle, vapor and hot water are produced. Features: Pump driven with 8-9 bars of dynamic pressure Pump driven with 8-9 bars of dynamic pressure Water tank holds 48 ounces of water Water tank holds 48 ounces of water Chrome plated brass brewing handle maintains ideal temperature of coffee Chrome plated brass brewing handle maintains ideal temperature of coffee Both ESE pod and ground coffee handle included Dimensions: 8-1/4 inches W by 10-1/4 inches D by 11-1/4 inches H. Weight: 16 pounds. Both ESE pod and ground coffee handle included Dimensions: 8-1/4 inches W by 10-1/4 inches D by 11-1/4 inches H. Weight: 16 pounds. See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41X1AE9WJCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Francis!Francis!","source_asin":"B0000AFX4L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-637851","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000AFX4L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000AFX4L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
