window.products.push({"id":637991,"name":"Deluxe Salt and Pepper Mill Grinder 2pc Set - RED","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dff9dQQzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Deluxe RED Salt and Pepper Grinders 2pc Set Peek into almost any restaurant kitchen and you’ll discover that chefs use these handy little grinders for grinding spices. When it comes to depth of flavor, ground spices from a jar just can’t compete with freshly ground whole spices. This spice grinders grinds all varieties of salt, sea salts, peppercorns, and other fresh spices. It allows you to grind your spices to perfection, quickly, and extremely easily. The spice grinder keeps the spices fresh with the sealed lid, and does not allow any moisture and dust to go in. Clean and Neat The sleek and neat look of these spice grinders are elegant to display. The grinders are smooth, and easy to grip. It is great to keep on the table at mealtime for easily adding spice to your food. · Deluxe 2 pc Set  · Grips easily, very sleek and neat. · Perfect for salts, and spices. · Top facing grinder, grind on top of your food. Manual grinders verses electric grinders · Manual grinding produce better taste than automatic grinders, because manual grinders don’t heat up during grinding. Most automatic grinders grind at a high speed, and thus the friction slightly increases the temperature of the spice, theoretically changing the taste of the spice. · Manual grinders don’t need electricity, making this a significant feature. If you like to camp and travel a lot, this grinder is made especially for you, being that it is small and does not need electricity for it to use. Satisfaction Warranty Deluxe 2pc RED Grinders are backed by a 30 day 100% MONEY BACK Warranty. No questions asked! Order Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dff9dQQzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elaine Karen","source_asin":"B01M3MJ15J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-637991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M3MJ15J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M3MJ15J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
